13:18.480 --> 13:19.480
Ada hal lain?

13:19.840 --> 13:21.159
Bos, semangat!

13:21.519 --> 13:22.720
Luo Zhou sentiasa sedia.

13:23.000 --> 13:24.399
Saya penyokong paling kuat bos.

13:25.480 --> 13:27.480
Nanti aku balik, kita bincang elok-elok.

13:28.879 --> 13:30.159
Eh, bukan... helo!

13:35.000 --> 13:36.360
Helo, awak dekat mana?

13:36.639 --> 13:37.480
Saya di tepi sungai.

13:38.200 --> 13:39.200
Awak keluar je, terus nampak saya.

14:23.080 --> 14:24.559
Akhirnya nak luah perasaan?

14:25.639 --> 14:26.879
Kenapa sekarang?

14:27.559 --> 14:29.240
Kenapa Sistem tak bagi petunjuk pun?

14:34.720 --> 14:35.440
Huan'er.

14:39.200 --> 14:39.960
Huan'er.

14:49.240 --> 14:49.919
Saya...

14:52.879 --> 14:54.240
Err, saya...

14:54.480 --> 14:55.039
Ia...

14:56.480 --> 14:58.120
Awak mesti tengok ramalan cuaca.

14:58.360 --> 15:00.519
Malam ni ada hujan meteor Leo.

15:00.759 --> 15:01.840
